In the big room of this castle, the eastern wall has a secret door in the
middle of it.  This is next to where the chest was.  Open this door.
There are several trapdoor into hell, so watch out.(Levitate).  When you
reach a point with just a wall between you and two of the dragon, either be
civilized and search, or kick in the wall.  Then they will fight you.

Tadah.  The short (2 spaces) hallways they are in have 2 doors on either
side of the other end.  4 rooms there are.  armor, gems, food, weapons.

